# The one real secret in this architecture: the Firebase service-account key.
# It lives ONLY in GitHub Actions (FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT) and on the
# admin's machine — these patterns catch an accidental drop into the repo.
*service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

